CONVERSATION:
hello stranger
Is it just me, or is no-one here English or American? And everyone seems to be a pervert, too.
im english! :D
and most likely not a pervert :P haha
Haha, fair enough. It just annoys me that there&apos;s nothing but people from central Europe and Asia and they all disconnect when I say i&apos;m male.
oh well if your male i less likely to disconnect :D
*im
how old are you?
Okay then. :). Hurrah, some decent conversation. And i&apos;m 19. How old are you?
oh :/ im 15.
and i am very good thankyou
you are very good with your punctuation and capital letters!
haha
Yeah. I was raised to be. It&apos;s sort of natural now. :P
and slow at typing to.. :S
no it&apos;s okay i understand :)
I&apos;m going to try and do it too. :D.
I&apos;m not THAT slow at typing. I just like making sure I don&apos;t make any mistakes and have to correct myself.
And fair enough. :).
Awhh, that&apos;s quite sweet. :). Haha.
Hahaha, it&apos;s not that sweet. Why does everyone say i&apos;m sweet? And i&apos;ve decided that i like you. You say &quot;Haha&quot; instead of &quot;lol&quot;.
Anyway, I&apos;m guessing your from England... I&apos;m I right?
Indeed you are. And i&apos;m going to guess that you&apos;re from England too. Either that or an English speaking country.
Oh, i do say &apos;lol&apos; sometimes... but now you&apos;ve said that, i won&apos;t.
So, it not just me who has said your sweet, awhh.. that means you really must be!
You are correct. :).
Where about from England?
Near London. I&apos;m originally from Bushey but moved to South Oxhey. Not that you have any idea where that is. Hertfordshire. What about you?
Also, I don&apos;t think i&apos;m sweet.
And you are right, I have absolutely NO clue! Haha. I&apos;m from the Southern part of England.. and lived there all my life. :)
What&apos;s wrong with being sweet...?
Girls like sweet.
That&apos;s only if you want a girl to think you sweet, if you don&apos;t, then they don&apos;t think it is.. haha.
Hahaha, no-one knows where Bushey and South Oxhey are. You might have heard of Watford (which is nearby) because of the football team though. And there&apos;s not really anything wrong with being sweet. I just don&apos;t think i&apos;m that sweet.
Fair enough. :) Still don&apos;t know where it is.. never mind though.
It&apos;s not like it matters where it is. Plus I can&apos;t describe it any better. I was always hopeless at geography and map reading.
Haha. No worries, nor am I, or I just can&apos;t be bothered!
That is to geography.. i really don&apos;t like that subject! Maybe it was because of my teacher.
Yeah i think that&apos;s the reason.
What was wrong with your teacher?
Anyway, what kind of music do you like?
Mostly punk-rock-ish stuff. But also some metal. And of course some classic rock like Meat Loaf. What about you?
She was just really stressy, and too serious for me.
Well, my taste are slightly different. I don&apos;t really like the &apos;punk-rock-ish stuff&apos; too much, i quite like single artists.. mostly males.
But i do like some bands.. and again, mostly males. Haha.
Girls, just really aren&apos;t that good. Do you agree?
Hahaha, fair enough. I&apos;m not being sexist or anything, but males do seem to be better musicians.
*girl bands
Yeah, i agree. Some women do do very well though!
Like.. Imogen Heap, or Regina Spector... Know them?
I like them :)
I&apos;ve heard of them, but i&apos;ve never listened to either.
There are quite mellow.. i think that&apos;s how you would describe them maybe.
personally, I don&apos;t think you&apos;ll like them.
Hahaha, you&apos;re probably right.
I like my music loud and with plenty of energy. :D.
Haha, makes sense. :)
Wow, impressive, i think this is the longest conversation I&apos;ve ever had on Omegle.. I think i went on a bit! Haha.
Maybe i should leave you in peace :P
Wait, you mean you would abandon me to those foreign fools? You&apos;re mean. :P
Haha, makes sense. :)'"}"")
