I&apos;m well, thanks
Where are you from?
Texas, you?
I&apos;m from New York.
Ohh, city or state?
State. I don&apos;t think I could tolerate living in New York city.
Haha I might, for a short period, just to see what it&apos;s like.
It&apos;s a cool place to visit.
I bet, maybe I will one day
And I am sure you would die to visit Texas, lol.
I&apos;ve been south, but not to Texas.
I&apos;ve been to Florid and Georgia.
