?
Hmm...I&apos;m not sure. My secret is that, I guess, I kinda have a crush on my friend when I shouldnt. Kinda the same as yours, I know.
Hmm, well it&apos;s a rather long story...
Ah, I know where you&apos;re at then...
Why shouldn&apos;t you have a crush on your friend?
Hmm, you first.
Haha, alright. Well it&apos;s my ex actually. We love each other still, but I shouldn&apos;t love him after all the shit he&apos;s put me through. So... yeah, that&apos;s that in a nutshell.
What about you?
Oh....hmm, that sucks. Any chance of getting back together? And mine is actually my ex bf too. I broke up with him like, two years ago, and I&apos;ve regretted it ever since, but it&apos;s too late now...=(
Well, probably, but... I don&apos;t think I could go through dealing with him again... I love him more than anything, but it hurts to be with him, you know? And I&apos;m sorry about your ex =/ Why is it too late?
Yeah. No offense, but it&apos;s not worth being with somebody who hurts you, so I wouldn&apos;t go back to him or anything. And it&apos;s too late because we go to different schools, don&apos;t see each other, etc. I don&apos;t even know if he has a gf right now, so oh well.
I mean I wouldn&apos;t go back to him if I were you. Hopefully that made sense, lol
Yeah, you&apos;re right. My friends all say the same thing, but it&apos;s hard letting go and he&apos;s not making it any easier since he still feels a lot for me? Idk... And it made sense, lol. And you said you&apos;re still friends with this guy right? Have you tried to meet up with him and what not?
Have you talked to him about it? And okay, lol. Well, more friends with his friends kind of thing. I don&apos;t have his email or number or anything, so we don&apos;t really see each other or talk. I guess we aren&apos;t really friends...
Yeah, we&apos;ve kind of talked about it... I&apos;ve really been wanting to just straight up say exactly what&apos;s on my mind, but I&apos;m still working up the courage for that, haha. Hmm, I see... Well you did date him at one point right? If I were you I&apos;d try and find out some sort of contact information from your friends and just say hi or something.
You guys know each other already so it won&apos;t be THAT awkward.
Yeah. Well being completely honest if the only way to move forward so..that&apos;s probably the best course of action then. =) And yeah, but it was like 2 years ago, and I&apos;m too shy to do that...kinda pathetic, I know, lol. I&apos;ve just been thinking about him a lot lately
It&apos;s not pathetic at all, I understand how you feel =/ I really think you should try and find some way to contact him, you&apos;ll only just keep thinking about it more and more.  And, who knows, maybe he&apos;ll be really happy to hear from you and you guys can meet up!
Hmm...yeah. =D Hopefully I can build the courage up for that, because it would be really nice. Hopefully he won&apos;t think I&apos;m a creepo, lol
I&apos;m sure you&apos;ll get there at one point :] And talking to mutual friends is are really good way to help build your courage for when you talk to him. And I&apos;m sure he won&apos;t think you&apos;re a creep, haha. He probably will be very glad to hear from you :D
Lol yeah maybe. =) Thanks, you really are a big help!
And you as well! You&apos;re very easy to talk to :]
Thanks, you too! It&apos;s nice to have an intelligent conversation on here, lol. It&apos;s a lot easier to read when you actually take time to spell out sentences and such. =P
I know right?! It actually bothers me quite a lot when people type in such shorthand because at a certain point it just becomes difficult to understand, haha. And most of the conversations I have on here are pretty dead right off the bat, but some of them are really great, like this one!
Yeah, I actually end up disconnecting after like a minute with a lot of them because a lot of people just don&apos;t go back to him or anything. And it&apos;s lots easy to read when you actually take time to spell out sentences and such. =P'"}"")
